WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.120
Here's how to steer with a thumbstick in PadForge,

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.890
for driving games when you have no wheel.

3
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.050
You're hearing a generated voice.

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.140
Open the controller, and go to the Sticks tab.

5
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.240
Each stick has a Steering section.

6
00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:19.149
Steering Mode starts on Off, which keeps it a normal stick.

7
00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.149
Pick Winding.

8
00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:24.624
Now turning the stick around winds a virtual wheel.

9
00:00:25.474 --> 00:00:30.424
Wind Range is the travel from lock to lock: 900 degrees, two and a half turns.

10
00:00:31.839 --> 00:00:36.569
Ease off the stick, and the wheel unwinds toward center, at the Unwind Rate.

11
00:00:38.294 --> 00:00:40.624
Angle to Axis is the other mode.

12
00:00:41.114 --> 00:00:45.404
The stick's angle maps straight to one axis, and letting go drops it to center.

13
00:00:46.769 --> 00:00:50.099
With the pad in hand, turn the stick in circles to steer.

14
00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.977
Find more guides at padforge.org.
